        "jsCode": "// Loop over all input items\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  if (item.json.nanobananaPrompt) {\n    // Regex explanation:\n    // [\\r\\n]+  -> Finds one or more newline characters (handles Windows & Linux style)\n    // ' '      -> Replaces them with a single space\n    item.json.nanobananaPrompt = item.json.nanobananaPrompt.replace(/[\\r\\n]+/g, ' ').trim();\n  }\n}\n\nreturn $input.all();"
